       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PRODUCTCODELOOKUP.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRODUCT-TABLE.
           05 PRODUCT-CODE PIC X(4) OCCURS 5 TIMES
               INDEXED BY PROD-IDX.
       01 PRODUCT-DESC-TABLE.
           05 PRODUCT-DESC PIC X(12) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 SEARCH-CODE PIC X(4) VALUE "P003".
       01 FOUND-DESC PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "P001" TO PRODUCT-CODE(1)
           MOVE "WIDGET" TO PRODUCT-DESC(1)
           MOVE "P002" TO PRODUCT-CODE(2)
           MOVE "GADGET" TO PRODUCT-DESC(2)
           MOVE "P003" TO PRODUCT-CODE(3)
           MOVE "GIZMO" TO PRODUCT-DESC(3)
           MOVE "P004" TO PRODUCT-CODE(4)
           MOVE "SPROCKET" TO PRODUCT-DESC(4)
           MOVE "P005" TO PRODUCT-CODE(5)
           MOVE "BRACKET" TO PRODUCT-DESC(5)

           SET PROD-IDX TO 1
           SEARCH PRODUCT-CODE
               AT END DISPLAY "CODE NOT FOUND: " SEARCH-CODE
               WHEN PRODUCT-CODE(PROD-IDX) = SEARCH-CODE
                   MOVE PRODUCT-DESC(PROD-IDX) TO FOUND-DESC
                   DISPLAY SEARCH-CODE " = " FOUND-DESC
           END-SEARCH
           STOP RUN.
